WEBVTT

00:00:01.031 --> 00:00:07.441
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:15.271
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.651 --> 00:00:21.091
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:26.251
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:33.151
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.331 --> 00:00:37.131
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:44.101
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.411 --> 00:00:52.211
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.381 --> 00:00:59.451
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.661 --> 00:01:05.691
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:11.661
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.671 --> 00:01:19.081
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.751 --> 00:01:27.021
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:33.861 --> 00:01:40.861
First you take a giant, round
egg and you add two bananas.

00:01:41.671 --> 00:01:44.541
Then you float a lake inside it while
two crescent moons shine below.

00:01:44.541 --> 00:01:46.841
Then you float a lake inside it while
two crescent moons shine below.
U-Uh, it's not that.

00:01:46.841 --> 00:01:47.911
Then you float a lake inside it while
two crescent moons shine below.
I mean...

00:01:47.911 --> 00:01:48.701
Then you float a lake inside it while
two crescent moons shine below.

00:01:48.771 --> 00:01:49.541
Hey, everyone!

00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:51.011
Hey, everyone!
W-What is it?

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:54.171
Ascot, I hope you weren't peekin'!

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:56.801
Come on! This is no time for jokes!

00:01:56.921 --> 00:01:59.351
Look at the screen on the ceiling!

00:02:03.461 --> 00:02:04.551
This is...

00:02:04.721 --> 00:02:07.351
It's the mobile fortress of Chizeta.

00:02:07.461 --> 00:02:08.451
Chizeta?

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:13.091
Chizeta's Bravada, Princesses Tatra
and Tarta's favorite conveyance.

00:02:13.201 --> 00:02:15.131
You sure know a lot.

00:02:22.311 --> 00:02:25.041
Appear, our guardian spirits...

00:02:27.651 --> 00:02:28.741
Djinn!

00:02:37.191 --> 00:02:39.161
What? It's starting to glow!

00:02:39.931 --> 00:02:40.891
Be careful.

00:02:40.961 --> 00:02:46.921
Umi and Fuu & Fahren and Chizeta

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:13.251
Disgusting!

00:03:14.491 --> 00:03:19.231
I believe that it was easier on the
eyes to fight that robot from Autozam.

00:03:27.141 --> 00:03:31.371
Do you fear the spirits of Chizeta's
two princesses, Tarta and Tatra...

00:03:31.481 --> 00:03:33.241
...legendary Rune-Gods?

00:03:33.551 --> 00:03:35.311
The tea is ready.

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:37.811
Would you like some, Tarta?

00:03:37.921 --> 00:03:39.821
Tatra!

00:03:43.021 --> 00:03:44.391
It's delicious.

00:03:44.491 --> 00:03:47.421
I'm tellin' ya we're
in the middle of a battle!

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:50.121
Tarta, your accent again.

00:03:50.231 --> 00:03:53.431
I don't give a hoot.
Just focus on the tussle!

00:03:53.531 --> 00:03:54.591
Oh my.

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:55.931
There, there.

00:03:57.641 --> 00:03:59.071
Let's get movin'.

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:40.501
W-What in the world is this?

00:05:03.471 --> 00:05:07.231
W-What is this?

00:05:08.271 --> 00:05:10.711
Is it dancing?

00:05:14.111 --> 00:05:16.671
Go, our guardian spirits, djinn!

00:05:20.721 --> 00:05:22.191
They are coming.

00:05:32.631 --> 00:05:37.001
I-I kind of don't want
to be touched by that!

00:05:37.971 --> 00:05:42.001
Are those beings
related to Chizeta after all?

00:05:42.171 --> 00:05:44.441
Djinn, Chizeta's guardian spirits.

00:05:44.541 --> 00:05:45.111
Selece?

00:05:45.111 --> 00:05:46.301
Selece?
Guardian spirits?

00:05:46.411 --> 00:05:50.011
The spirits that protect
the two princesses of Chizeta.

00:05:50.181 --> 00:05:54.621
S-Spirit sounds too cute
for them. They look more like...

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.881
...genies from a magic lamp.

00:06:09.301 --> 00:06:10.491
They come!

00:06:25.981 --> 00:06:27.581
They are powerful!

00:06:36.761 --> 00:06:39.161
Don't hold hands! Not the hands!

00:06:48.571 --> 00:06:50.301
L-Lady Aska!

00:06:52.641 --> 00:06:55.941
Those things are not beautiful!

00:06:56.581 --> 00:07:01.881
Chizeta's princesses have the worst
taste to use those things as guardians!

00:07:06.321 --> 00:07:10.781
Oh, you sneezed. I'm sure
someone is talking about you.

00:07:12.131 --> 00:07:14.161
My, a second sneeze.

00:07:14.271 --> 00:07:17.061
Two sneezes
mean it's something bad!

00:07:17.171 --> 00:07:18.261
Sister!

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:20.961
Please take this battle seriously!

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:25.231
Oh, Tarta... You get angry too quickly.

00:07:34.821 --> 00:07:37.341
For having such
weird faces, they're powerful!

00:07:37.461 --> 00:07:40.151
Do not take
the spirits of Chizeta lightly.

00:07:40.261 --> 00:07:43.351
They possess considerable
power and technique.

00:07:48.431 --> 00:07:50.031
Magic Knight, thy magic!

00:07:50.501 --> 00:07:51.531
Right!

00:07:51.641 --> 00:07:54.001
Winds of Admonishment!

00:07:59.181 --> 00:08:00.941
You did it, Fuu.

00:08:16.791 --> 00:08:17.761
Fuu!

00:08:21.331 --> 00:08:22.201
Fuu!

00:08:28.641 --> 00:08:29.571
Hikaru!

00:08:29.811 --> 00:08:31.571
Where are you going?

00:08:32.911 --> 00:08:35.351
Umi and Fuu are...

00:08:43.721 --> 00:08:47.121
You cannot call your
Rune-God without your sword.

00:08:50.561 --> 00:08:51.891
Calm down, Hikaru.

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:56.891
Mokona...

00:09:02.441 --> 00:09:03.531
Hikaru...

00:09:06.541 --> 00:09:07.641
Presea...

00:09:07.881 --> 00:09:10.311
I'm just as worried as you.

00:09:12.481 --> 00:09:13.781
Ferio...

00:09:14.751 --> 00:09:17.551
Everyone is worried
about Umi and Fuu.

00:09:18.191 --> 00:09:20.121
And about you too, Hikaru.

00:09:22.531 --> 00:09:24.461
If I don't have a sword...

00:09:25.131 --> 00:09:28.221
If I can't fight with Rayearth...

00:09:29.671 --> 00:09:32.161
...I can't do anything.

00:09:44.421 --> 00:09:45.471
Ms. Umi!

00:09:51.661 --> 00:09:53.351
Are you all right?

00:09:53.461 --> 00:09:54.651
Somehow!

00:09:57.601 --> 00:10:00.501
The legendary Rune-Gods
are no match for us.

00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:04.131
Or rather, I think they are disgusted.

00:10:04.971 --> 00:10:06.061
With what?

00:10:07.771 --> 00:10:09.541
With our spirits.

00:10:10.041 --> 00:10:11.801
Why would they be?

00:10:13.611 --> 00:10:14.701
Tarta...

00:10:15.081 --> 00:10:18.851
What do you think when you
look at those spirits, our djinn?

00:10:20.991 --> 00:10:22.041
Handsome.

00:10:23.091 --> 00:10:24.521
I get it now.

00:10:25.061 --> 00:10:27.991
Tarta, your future
husband will surely...

00:10:28.831 --> 00:10:30.591
...look just like them.

00:10:41.671 --> 00:10:44.011
I'm telling you to stop that!

00:10:47.911 --> 00:10:50.351
I wonder what that dance is...

00:10:50.781 --> 00:10:53.881
I don't know what it is, but for now...

00:10:54.491 --> 00:10:56.751
...I can say it's really weird!

00:11:15.471 --> 00:11:20.601
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:22.481 --> 00:11:26.611
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:41.321
They're disgusting!

00:11:41.431 --> 00:11:43.761
Lady Aska, steady yourself!

00:11:44.371 --> 00:11:47.131
Chizeta people have
bad taste after all!

00:11:53.111 --> 00:11:55.051
All right, spirit djinn!

00:11:55.151 --> 00:11:58.911
Go on and bring back the legendary
Rune-Gods to the mobile fortress!

00:11:59.021 --> 00:12:01.811
Oh, we're inviting guests?

00:12:02.691 --> 00:12:05.951
Not guests!
The legendary Rune-Gods!

00:12:07.091 --> 00:12:10.191
Anyone who visits us is a guest.

00:12:12.001 --> 00:12:16.261
Anyway, capture those Rune-Gods
that are said to protect Cephiro!

00:12:20.441 --> 00:12:24.031
Oh, the Rune-Gods are being
kidnapped by those weird things!

00:12:24.411 --> 00:12:25.281
Sang Yung!

00:12:25.281 --> 00:12:26.241
Sang Yung!
Yes!

00:12:26.341 --> 00:12:27.281
Brush and paper!

00:12:27.281 --> 00:12:28.471
Brush and paper!
Yes!

00:12:28.581 --> 00:12:29.671
B-But...

00:12:30.011 --> 00:12:31.421
I don't care. Just do it!

00:12:31.421 --> 00:12:32.971
I don't care. Just do it!
Y-Yes!

00:12:33.081 --> 00:12:34.681
Wait, Sang Yung!

00:12:39.221 --> 00:12:41.191
If Chizeta is using that...

00:12:46.761 --> 00:12:50.031
Secret Spell of
Dragon Art Reincarnation!

00:12:52.901 --> 00:12:57.171
Lady Aska, you're using
high-level illusions on a whim again...

00:13:34.351 --> 00:13:36.511
W-What's that sound?

00:14:12.351 --> 00:14:14.551
S-Something's approaching us.

00:14:14.651 --> 00:14:16.591
I wonder what that is.

00:14:25.801 --> 00:14:27.131
It's huge!

00:14:38.181 --> 00:14:40.581
No... What in the world?

00:14:44.321 --> 00:14:48.271
If Chizeta is going to give us weird
things, I'll bring a giant Sang Yung!

00:14:48.391 --> 00:14:50.551
However, this is in bad taste too...

00:14:50.661 --> 00:14:52.621
Go, giant Sang Yung!

00:14:52.991 --> 00:14:56.121
And defeat those
weird things with poor taste!

00:15:06.201 --> 00:15:08.641
W-What in the world is that?

00:15:29.031 --> 00:15:32.291
What is that thing
with the carefree face?

00:15:32.401 --> 00:15:33.991
Oh, it's cute!

00:15:34.471 --> 00:15:35.831
It's not cute!

00:15:35.931 --> 00:15:38.561
It chucked our spirits away! Poof!

00:15:39.301 --> 00:15:42.641
It was cute how it went poof.

00:15:42.741 --> 00:15:44.001
Damn it!

00:15:50.451 --> 00:15:52.381
Go, spirit djinn!

00:15:53.081 --> 00:15:55.421
Defeat that enormous child!

00:16:50.141 --> 00:16:51.571
W-What is this?

00:16:52.111 --> 00:16:56.481
A monster movie... No, it is more
like a Hong Kong action movie.

00:16:56.911 --> 00:16:59.941
It's much weirder than
any Hong Kong movie!

00:17:00.051 --> 00:17:04.181
That is an illusion that only
the Fahren royal family can use.

00:17:04.291 --> 00:17:05.191
Fahren!

00:17:05.291 --> 00:17:07.451
The same as the dancing lion before.

00:17:07.561 --> 00:17:12.331
Spirits and illusions are both created
by those with very strong hearts.

00:17:13.231 --> 00:17:18.001
Then there is a possibility that one
of them will become the new Pillar?

00:17:23.011 --> 00:17:27.411
The Rune-Gods are mine.
I will become the princess of Cephiro.

00:17:27.511 --> 00:17:28.211
Sang Yung!

00:17:28.211 --> 00:17:29.081
Sang Yung!
Y-Yes!

00:17:29.181 --> 00:17:31.911
Not you, I meant
the giant Sang Yung!

00:17:32.021 --> 00:17:33.111
I see...

00:17:33.421 --> 00:17:34.781
Giant Sang Yung!

00:17:34.891 --> 00:17:37.791
Bring the Rune-Gods to me!

00:17:44.561 --> 00:17:47.221
Hold on! It's headed our way.

00:17:47.331 --> 00:17:49.931
Its face is very friendly, however...

00:18:13.661 --> 00:18:14.591
Fuu!

00:18:16.591 --> 00:18:19.931
Water Dragon!

00:18:58.571 --> 00:18:59.001
Umi!

00:18:59.001 --> 00:18:59.901
Umi!
Fuu!

00:19:00.001 --> 00:19:01.601
Umi! Fuu!

00:19:04.111 --> 00:19:04.941
W-What goin' on?

00:19:04.941 --> 00:19:06.481
W-What goin' on?
Umi, come on! Umi!

00:19:06.481 --> 00:19:07.271
Umi, come on! Umi!

00:19:07.381 --> 00:19:09.211
The Rune-Gods fell to enemy hands.

00:19:09.211 --> 00:19:10.081
The Rune-Gods fell to enemy hands.
What?

00:19:10.181 --> 00:19:12.381
Most likely to Chizeta and Fahren.

00:19:12.481 --> 00:19:13.581
No way...

00:19:14.021 --> 00:19:15.421
Umi! Fuu!

00:19:16.021 --> 00:19:17.111
Umi...

00:19:17.291 --> 00:19:18.381
Fuu...

00:19:29.801 --> 00:19:32.891
Do you want to revive
the sword at any cost?

00:19:33.171 --> 00:19:34.231
Yes.

00:19:35.511 --> 00:19:38.771
Even if it means
risking your own life?

00:19:42.711 --> 00:19:43.651
Yes.

00:19:46.221 --> 00:19:47.481
All right.

00:19:48.451 --> 00:19:49.611
Let's go.

00:20:19.081 --> 00:20:21.711
My dear daughter, Nova.

00:20:21.991 --> 00:20:22.921
Mother!

00:20:30.901 --> 00:20:33.661
Mother, I want
to play with Hikaru again.

00:20:34.101 --> 00:20:37.761
The door for us
is already within Cephiro.

00:20:40.441 --> 00:20:41.671
Soon.

00:20:42.171 --> 00:20:43.641
I'm so happy!

00:20:44.141 --> 00:20:49.101
You know... I found a new
feeling within Hikaru's heart.

00:20:51.851 --> 00:20:54.371
Different from her
feelings for her teammates.

00:20:54.491 --> 00:20:57.481
One Hikaru herself hasn't realized yet.

00:20:58.291 --> 00:21:00.051
Do you want it?

00:21:01.731 --> 00:21:03.961
I'm Hikaru after all.

00:21:17.681 --> 00:21:19.801
What's wrong, Lantis?

00:21:21.451 --> 00:21:22.381
Nothing.

00:21:23.381 --> 00:21:25.871
The evil presence
has grown stronger...

00:21:25.981 --> 00:21:29.351
And that girl's voice before...

00:21:29.551 --> 00:21:30.991
What was that?

00:21:42.201 --> 00:21:44.961
The Magic Knights
have been separated?

00:21:46.171 --> 00:21:48.901
And the one inside
the castle of Cephiro...

00:21:50.511 --> 00:21:51.771
...is Hikaru.

00:22:17.941 --> 00:22:23.341
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.011 --> 00:22:31.281
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.721 --> 00:22:38.281
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.991 --> 00:22:42.791
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.161 --> 00:22:45.531
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.361 --> 00:22:50.661
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.041 --> 00:22:54.371
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.811 --> 00:23:01.711
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.151 --> 00:23:05.551
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.881 --> 00:23:14.311
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.161 --> 00:23:20.491
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.731 --> 00:23:28.801
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.871 --> 00:23:37.681
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.261 --> 00:23:48.161
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.691 --> 00:23:53.131
Presea told me that there
was a way to revive my sword.

00:23:53.231 --> 00:23:57.691
But she added that it was
a life-threatening challenge to do it.

00:23:57.801 --> 00:24:00.461
I don't care.
To save my two friends...

00:24:00.571 --> 00:24:04.701
...and to be able to fight for
myself, I have to revive my sword!

00:24:04.911 --> 00:24:06.881
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.141 --> 00:24:09.341
Hikaru's Wish and Presea's Secret.

00:24:09.411 --> 00:24:10.251
Hikaru's Wish and Presea's Secret

00:24:10.251 --> 00:24:12.251
Hikaru's Wish and Presea's Secret
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.251 --> 00:24:13.421
Hikaru's Wish and Presea's Secret

00:24:13.421 --> 00:24:20.351
Who is it today?

00:24:21.391 --> 00:24:23.331
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:23.431 --> 00:24:23.961
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.961 --> 00:24:26.801
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.801 --> 00:24:28.471
Look forward to the next episode!
See you later!

00:24:28.471 --> 00:24:29.401
Look forward to the next episode!
